%% Diagram: Route Selection

flowchart LR
    Conversation["Conversation<br/>git_remote, adapter_id, branch, name"] --> Evaluate["Evaluate every route"]
    Routes["Route list<br/>glob match per field<br/>AND semantics within a route"] --> Evaluate
    Evaluate --> Matches["Collect all matching routes"]
    Matches --> Union["Union sink IDs from all matches"]
    Union --> Any{"any matches?"}

    Any -->|No| LocalOnly["No push<br/>safe zero-state"]
    Any -->|Yes| Targets["Return matching sinks"]

    Wildcard["Explicit wildcard route<br/>{ match: {}, sinks: [...] }"] -. if you want catch-all .-> Routes
    NoDefault["No defaultSinks"] -. safety rule .-> LocalOnly
